{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             ﻿\n \n \n \n こんにちは！\n \n 久しぶりになってしまってごめんなさい😖\n \n \n \n \n この前のそこさくで振袖を着させて頂きました！\n \n たくさん写真とったよ〜☺️\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ6NEE7K07T90XMMNTX3GR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ6Q53HYW5TDRW8XBBCE4M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ6SDCCAD6KEBA3NQT6H1P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ6TY54Q2YNN0SHRG2Q3VM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ6XM8SRS7CT9APAYJ17MS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ6Z8AM743MP4Q70R8QAJG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n ファビ丸くんが私の所に来てくれたので、澤部さんにソファを買って頂ける事になりました🦅\n \n \n 今年の運使い切っちゃったなぁ😖\n \n \n ソファとっても楽しみです☺️🛋\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n そしてRay2月号発売中です！\n \n ヘアとメイクの撮影をしたよ〜♡\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ716HBCEJEDD3V369WPWK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 可愛いヘアアレンジやディズニーランドに行く時のメイクを紹介しています🐭🏰\n \n 連載では、バレンタインのカップケーキをつくりました🧁🤍\n \n \n \n 是非ご覧下さい〜！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ72KH4DX0BFMN7RXS2RQ4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ74N1DZBVVZ68HB39ZR6V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n またね☺️             "}],"source":"archive"}